{
  "_readme": [
    "The shipped Lage-Grundgerüst «fks-standard» — the handful of things every Lage needs in its",
    "first minutes, per Einsatzart (the alarm keyword categories of ../alarm_keywords.json).",
    "",
    "Each slot places ONE thing on the Karte: `symbol` is a name out of public/tactical-symbols.json,",
    "`linie` a line preset (appConfig.drawing.linePresets, by label). `vorschlag` is where the app",
    "suggests putting it: { \"naechster\": \"hydrant\" } = the nearest hydrant of the station's",
    "hydrant layer, { \"wind\": \"auf\", \"m\": N } = N metres upwind of the Einsatzort. A suggestion",
    "is only ever a starting point to drag. `optional: true` shows the slot but does not count it.",
    "",
    "A station does not edit this file: it sets `lageGrundgeruest` in its deployment config",
    "(docs/CONFIGURATION.md §1e), where `kategorien` replace single Einsatzarten of the preset.",
    "Chemiewehr and Ölwehr carry the same list on purpose — one Grundgerüst for both.",
    "The Absperrkreis is the Gefahrentafel: its UN-Nr. draws the ERG Schutzabstand rings",
    "(src/lib/ergRings), which is the one Absperrkreis the app can place from data."
  ],
